        <div className="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs text-[#A5C9CA] font-semibold">
          <span>✓ Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)</span>
          <span>✓ Real-time Inspection Trail</span>
          <span>✓ Multi-actor Attribution</span>
